  "notes": "线路和更新更直接。\n\n- 线路页不再显示已删除的 AI · 美国、AI · US、AI candidates、悦通服务和 Yue Services。缓存订阅会去掉这些分组，原先走悦通服务的流量改走兜底分流，不再自动直连。\n- 自动下载开启后，会在任何网络下载更新，包括蜂窝和计费网络。关闭后不会在后台下载。没有保存过这个设置时仍然默认开启。\n- 关于页只保留检查更新。自动下载开关在偏好设置里。单独的「计费网络也下载」开关已去掉。\n",
  "notesEn": "Clearer routes and simpler updates.\n\n- The routes page no longer lists the removed AI · US, AI candidates, or Yue Services groups. Cached subscriptions drop those groups, and traffic that used Yue Services now uses Catch-All instead of a direct connection.\n- When automatic download is on, updates download on any network, including cellular and metered connections. When it is off, the app does not download updates in the background. A missing preference still defaults to on.\n- About keeps the update check. The automatic-download switch stays in preferences. The separate metered-download switch is gone.\n",
